@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-5: Task Execution, Deliverable Submission and Evidence Verification (WF-11, WF-14, WF-15, WF-16, WF-17)
|Assignee|
start
:Open assigned task;
:Set status In Progress;
|System|
if (User is assignee and dependencies satisfied?) then (no)
  :Reject status change;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Store status change in task history;
endif
|Assignee|
repeat
  :Submit GitHub repository URL and optional\ncommit, pull request, screenshots, documents;
  |System|
  :Validate GitHub URL, file types and sizes;
  :Store new submission version\nset Pending Verification and task Under Review;
  :Notify Team Leader and queue verification;
  repeat
    |GitHub|
    :Return repository access result;
    |System|
    if (Temporary access failure?) then (yes)
      :Keep Pending Verification and retry;
    else (no)
    endif
  repeat while (Retry pending?) is (yes)
  if (Repository accessible?) then (no)
    :Record evidence as inaccessible;
    :Set Requires Resubmission;
  else (yes)
    |GitHub|
    :Provide file tree, README, files, commits;
    |AI Supervisor|
    :Evaluate each acceptance criterion\nagainst evidence excerpts;
    |System|
    :Map criterion results to status by fixed rules;
  endif
  :Store verification report and notify student and Team Leader;
  |Supervisor|
  if (Supervisor reviews result?) then (yes)
    :Review evidence and AI report;
    if (Override or decide?) then (yes)
      :Approve, reject or request resubmission\nwith recorded reason;
      |System|
      :Store decision and keep AI result in history;
    else (no)
    endif
  else (no)
  endif
  |System|
  if (Verified or supervisor approved?) then (yes)
    :Set task Completed;
    :Recalculate sprint, phase and project progress;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Set task In Progress with feedback;
  endif
  |Assignee|
  :Review verification feedback and correct issues;
repeat while (Resubmit?) is (yes)
stop
@enduml
